.docname {Telemetry Types}
.docauthor {BakingRL}
.include {docs}
.doclang {en}

The SDK exports Rocket League telemetry event names and payload types.

```ts
import type {
  RlTelemetryEventName,
  RlTelemetryPayloadByEvent
} from "@bakingrl/plugin-sdk";
```

## Typed Subscription Example

```ts
context.bus.subscribe("UpdateState", (event) => {
  const players = event.Data.Players;
  const teams = event.Data.Game.Teams;
});
```

## Supported Event Names

The SDK currently models:

- `UpdateState`
- `BallHit`
- `ClockUpdatedSeconds`
- `CountdownBegin`
- `CrossbarHit`
- `GoalReplayEnd`
- `GoalReplayStart`
- `GoalReplayWillEnd`
- `GoalScored`
- `MatchCreated`
- `MatchInitialized`
- `MatchDestroyed`
- `MatchEnded`
- `MatchPaused`
- `MatchUnpaused`
- `PodiumStart`
- `ReplayCreated`
- `ReplayWillEnd`
- `RoundStarted`
- `StatfeedEvent`

Use unknown-safe handling for plugin-defined events such as
`plugin.com.example.package.state`.
